#
# nftban Local Suricata Rules
# ===========================
# This file contains:
#   1. User-defined custom rules
#   2. nftban-generated rules (auto-managed section at bottom)
#
# Rule format: Suricata rule syntax
# See: https://suricata.readthedocs.io/en/latest/rules/
#
# Example custom rule:
#   alert tcp any any -> any 22 (msg:"SSH connection attempt"; sid:1000001; rev:1;)
#
# SID ranges:
#   1000000-1999999: Local rules (user-defined)
#   9000000-9999999: nftban auto-generated rules
#
# WARNING: Do not edit the auto-generated section below the marker.
#          Those rules are managed by nftban and may be overwritten.

# ===========================================================================
# USER CUSTOM RULES - Add your rules below this line
# ===========================================================================



# ===========================================================================
# NFTBAN AUTO-GENERATED RULES - DO NOT EDIT BELOW THIS LINE
# ===========================================================================
# [nftban-auto-start]
# [nftban-auto-end]
